### =====================================================
### Receive Position Event - Casos de prueba
### Endpoint ANONIMO ([AllowAnonymous]) pero valida el ApiKey
### del body contra Common (spAPI_Account_ValidateApiKey).
### No lleva header Authorization.
### =====================================================

### Test 1: Recibir evento de posicion con ApiKey valido — esperado 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/Telemetry/receivePositionEvent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitIdentifier": "TEST-UNIT-001",
  "unitId": "TEST-UNIT-001",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "apiKey": "{{apiKey}}",
  "user_permission_settings": "{\"locationAlways\":1,\"locationWhenInUse\":1,\"ignoreBatteryOptimizations\":1,\"activityRecognition\":1}",
  "rawData": {
    "event": "geofence",
    "timestamp": "2026-08-21T15:30:00Z",
    "latitude": 14.634915,
    "longitude": -90.506882,
    "speed": 12.5,
    "heading": 90.0,
    "odometer": 12500.5,
    "battery": 0.85
  }
}

### Test 2: Solo unitId (sin unitIdentifier) — esperado 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/Telemetry/receivePositionEvent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitId": "TEST-UNIT-001",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "apiKey": "{{apiKey}}",
  "rawData": {
    "event": "motionchange",
    "timestamp": "2026-08-21T15:35:00Z",
    "latitude": 14.640112,
    "longitude": -90.512345,
    "speed": 0.0,
    "isMoving": false
  }
}

### Test 3: ApiKey invalido — esperado 401 (Invalid ApiKey)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Telemetry/receivePositionEvent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitIdentifier": "TEST-UNIT-001",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "apiKey": "apikey-invalido-12345",
  "rawData": {
    "event": "geofence",
    "timestamp": "2026-08-21T15:30:00Z",
    "latitude": 14.634915,
    "longitude": -90.506882
  }
}

### Test 4: Sin ApiKey en el body — esperado 401 (Invalid ApiKey)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Telemetry/receivePositionEvent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitIdentifier": "TEST-UNIT-001",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "rawData": {
    "event": "geofence",
    "timestamp": "2026-08-21T15:30:00Z",
    "latitude": 14.634915,
    "longitude": -90.506882
  }
}

### Test 5: Sin unitIdentifier ni unitId — esperado 400 (UnitIdentifier or UnitId is required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Telemetry/receivePositionEvent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "apiKey": "{{apiKey}}",
  "rawData": {
    "event": "geofence",
    "timestamp": "2026-08-21T15:30:00Z",
    "latitude": 14.634915,
    "longitude": -90.506882
  }
}

### Test 6: Sin rawData — esperado 400 (RawData is required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Telemetry/receivePositionEvent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unitIdentifier": "TEST-UNIT-001",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "apiKey": "{{apiKey}}"
}
